# Freenove-4WD-Car-Kit-ESP32-noradio -- the LX6 perf sibling's filesystem.  [P296]
#
# ONE LINE, DELIBERATELY: the whole difference between this and the shipped 4WD is the BUILD (no
# radio linked, which is what frees the IRAM the NCG exec pool needs).  Nothing about the Scheme
# side changes, and the perf tiers load bench-runner/benchmarks from the RESIDENT filesystem -- so a
# second copy of that file list would be a second thing to keep in step, which is exactly how this
# board lost its perf legs once already ([B1027]).
extends: Freenove-4WD-Car-Kit-ESP32
